{"seq":2,"slug":"inverted-index","title":"倒排索引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/foundations/inverted-index","wordCount":935,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"倒排索引\">倒排索引</h1><p>倒排索引（Inverted Index）是信息检索系统的核心数据结构，将词项（term）映射到包含该词项的文档列表。与正向索引（文档 → 词列表）相反，倒排索引支持在海量文档集合中以毫秒级完成词项查找。理解倒排索引的设计细节——从 posting list 的压缩存储到 index merge 策略——直接决定搜索系统的性能上限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>倒排索引由**词典（Dictionary）**和 <strong>posting lists</strong> 两部分组成：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph Dictionary[词典(词典树/哈希表)]&#10;        T1[python]&#10;        T2[web]&#10;        T3[framework]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph PL[Posting Lists]&#10;        PL1[[d1:3, d3:1, d5:7, d9:2]&quot;]&#10;        PL2[[d1:2, d2:5, d5:1]&quot;]&#10;        PL3[[d3:4, d5:2, d7:1]&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    T1 --&gt; PL1&#10;    T2 --&gt; PL2&#10;    T3 --&gt; PL3\">graph LR\n    subgraph Dictionary[词典(词典树/哈希表)]\n        T1[python]\n        T2[web]\n        T3[framework]\n    end\n    subgraph PL[Posting Lists]\n        PL1[[d1:3, d3:1, d5:7, d9:2]\"]\n        PL2[[d1:2, d2:5, d5:1]\"]\n        PL3[[d3:4, d5:2, d7:1]\"]\n    end\n    T1 --&gt; PL1\n    T2 --&gt; PL2\n    T3 --&gt; PL3</pre><p>每个 posting entry 通常包含：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"posting = {&#10;  doc_id: uint32,       // 文档 ID（全局唯一）&#10;  term_freq: uint16,    // 词项在该文档中的出现次数&#10;  positions: [uint32],  // 词项在文档中的位置列表（短语查询需要）&#10;  field_mask: uint8,    // 词项出现在哪些字段（标题/正文/URL）&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>posting = {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  doc_id: uint32,       // 文档 ID（全局唯一）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  term_freq: uint16,    // 词项在该文档中的出现次数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  positions: [uint32],  // 词项在文档中的位置列表（短语查询需要）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  field_mask: uint8,    // 词项出现在哪些字段（标题/正文/URL）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>占用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>doc_id</td>\n<td>倒排列表的主键，用于 AND/OR 合并</td>\n<td>必须</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>term_freq</td>\n<td>BM25 计算中的 tf 值</td>\n<td>多数场景必须</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>positions</td>\n<td>短语查询（phrase query）、proximity 查询</td>\n<td>按需存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>field_mask</td>\n<td>BM25F 字段加权</td>\n<td>按需存储</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"posting-list-的跳表加速\">Posting List 的跳表加速</h2><p>当 posting list 很长（高频词如 &quot;the&quot; 可能有数百万条 posting），两个列表做 AND 合并时，直接线性扫描效率低。<strong>跳表（Skip List）</strong> 在 posting list 中每隔 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mi>L</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{L}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.1133em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9267em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8867em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1133em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 条记录插入一个跳跃指针：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"原始 posting list: [1, 3, 7, 12, 23, 34, 45, 67, 89, 102, ...]&#10;&#10;加入跳表后：&#10;  [1] → skip_to(23) → skip_to(45) → skip_to(89) → ...&#10;   |                   |               |&#10;   1,3,7,12         23,34           45,67\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>原始 posting list: [1, 3, 7, 12, 23, 34, 45, 67, 89, 102, ...]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>加入跳表后：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  [1] → skip_to(23) → skip_to(45) → skip_to(89) → ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   |                   |               |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>   1,3,7,12         23,34           45,67</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>跳表加速 AND 合并</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"合并 list_A = [1,3,7,23,45,89]  (短)&#10;合并 list_B = [1,2,5,7,12,23,34,45,67,89,102]  (长，有跳表)&#10;&#10;第1步：A[0]=1, B[0]=1 → 匹配，输出 1&#10;第2步：A[1]=3, B 用跳表跳到 skip≥3 的位置 → B 指向 5&#10;第3步：A[1]=3 &lt; B[当前]=5 → A 前进到 7&#10;第4步：A[2]=7, B 用跳表跳 → 找到 B[3]=7 → 匹配，输出 7&#10;...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>合并 list_A = [1,3,7,23,45,89]  (短)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>合并 list_B = [1,2,5,7,12,23,34,45,67,89,102]  (长，有跳表)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>第1步：A[0]=1, B[0]=1 → 匹配，输出 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>第2步：A[1]=3, B 用跳表跳到 skip≥3 的位置 → B 指向 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>第3步：A[1]=3 &#x3C; B[当前]=5 → A 前进到 7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>第4步：A[2]=7, B 用跳表跳 → 找到 B[3]=7 → 匹配，输出 7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>...</span></span></code></pre></div><p>跳表将平均合并复杂度从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(L_1+L_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降低到接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(L_1 \\log L_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（对短列表而言）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"posting-list-压缩算法\">Posting List 压缩算法</h2><p>倒排索引在存储上采用<strong>差值编码（d-gap encoding）</strong>：将排好序的 doc_id 列表转为相邻差值，因为差值通常很小，便于压缩。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"原始 doc_id: [1, 4, 7, 12, 23, 24, 25]&#10;d-gap 编码: [1, 3, 3, 5, 11, 1, 1]   (每个数 = 当前 - 前一个)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>原始 doc_id: [1, 4, 7, 12, 23, 24, 25]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>d-gap 编码: [1, 3, 3, 5, 11, 1, 1]   (每个数 = 当前 - 前一个)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两种主流压缩编码：</p>\n<p><strong>Variable Byte Encoding（VByte）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个字节用低 7 位存数据，最高位表示是否继续</li>\n<li>小数值（&lt;128）只需 1 字节，较大数值用 2-3 字节</li>\n<li>解码速度快，实现简单</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"d-gap 值 → VByte 编码:&#10;  3  → 0000_0011  (1字节，最高位0=终止)&#10;  200 → 1000_0001 0100_1000  (2字节)&#10;  300 → 1000_0010 0010_1100  (2字节)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>d-gap 值 → VByte 编码:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  3  → 0000_0011  (1字节，最高位0=终止)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  200 → 1000_0001 0100_1000  (2字节)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  300 → 1000_0010 0010_1100  (2字节)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>PForDelta（Patched Frame Of Reference Delta）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>将 128 个连续 d-gap 值分为一组，找到能覆盖 90% 值的位宽 b</li>\n<li>用 b 位存储&quot;普通值&quot;，另外用 patch 列表存储超出范围的&quot;异常值&quot;</li>\n<li>利用 SIMD 指令可以批量解码，吞吐量比 VByte 高 2-4 倍</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>压缩率</th>\n<th>解码速度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>VByte</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>通用，实现简单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PForDelta</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>极快（SIMD）</td>\n<td>高频词长列表，Lucene 默认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Simple-9</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>嵌入式场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Roaring Bitmap</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>过滤型查询，文档 ID 密集时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"索引构建与-index-merge\">索引构建与 Index Merge</h2><p>实际的索引构建分为两阶段：</p>\n<p><strong>内存索引（In-memory segment）</strong>：新文档先写入内存中的小型倒排索引（Elasticsearch 中称 in-memory buffer），内存满或达到时间阈值后 <strong>refresh</strong> 到磁盘形成一个不可变的 segment（Lucene segment）。</p>\n<p><strong>Segment 合并（Index Merge）</strong>：随着文档积累，磁盘上会有大量小 segment，查询需要扫描所有 segment。定期执行 <strong>merge</strong> 将多个小 segment 合并为大 segment：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    S1[segment-1\\n100 docs] --&gt; M1[merge\\nprocess]&#10;    S2[segment-2\\n150 docs] --&gt; M1&#10;    S3[segment-3\\n80 docs] --&gt; M1&#10;    M1 --&gt; SNew[segment-new\\n330 docs\\n优化后的倒排索引]\">graph LR\n    S1[segment-1\\n100 docs] --&gt; M1[merge\\nprocess]\n    S2[segment-2\\n150 docs] --&gt; M1\n    S3[segment-3\\n80 docs] --&gt; M1\n    M1 --&gt; SNew[segment-new\\n330 docs\\n优化后的倒排索引]</pre><p>Merge 策略（以 Lucene/Elasticsearch 为例）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>TieredMergePolicy（默认）</td>\n<td>按 segment 大小分层，同层段超过 10 个时触发合并</td>\n<td>通用，写入稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LogByteSizeMergePolicy</td>\n<td>按字节大小的对数分组</td>\n<td>大批量导入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LogDocMergePolicy</td>\n<td>按文档数的对数分组</td>\n<td>文档大小均匀时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>删除文档的处理</strong>：Lucene segment 是不可变的，删除文档通过维护一个 <strong>delete bitmap</strong> 实现，实际物理删除在下次 merge 时完成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>倒排索引 = 词典（快速词查找）+ posting lists（文档列表，含 tf 和位置）</li>\n<li><strong>跳表</strong>让长列表的 AND 合并从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(L_1+L_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到接近 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(L_1 \\log L_2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>d-gap + VByte/PForDelta</strong> 是工业界主流压缩方案；PForDelta 利用 SIMD 可达极高解码吞吐</li>\n<li><strong>Segment 架构</strong>（Lucene/ES）：内存 buffer → refresh 成不可变 segment → 定期 merge 优化查询性能</li>\n<li>删除采用 delete bitmap，物理删除延迟到 merge</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>章内延伸</strong>：文本预处理（本章第 3 篇）决定了进入倒排索引的词项质量；BM25（第 2 章第 1 篇）利用倒排索引存储的 tf 值计算排序得分。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"倒排索引","id":"倒排索引"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Posting List 的跳表加速","id":"posting-list-的跳表加速"},{"level":2,"text":"Posting List 压缩算法","id":"posting-list-压缩算法"},{"level":2,"text":"索引构建与 Index Merge","id":"索引构建与-index-merge"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"IR 经典模型概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/foundations/ir-classic-models"},"next":{"title":"文本预处理管道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/information-retrieval-fundamentals/foundations/text-preprocessing"}}